      "writtenOn": "2022-04-19T17:50:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we have a build-time check to enforce all period values are multiples of HOOK_TICK_INTERVAL_MS? People are not aware of this implicit flooring. A build-time error forces the developer to modify the values.",
